<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S6.T3.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S6.T3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Direct Assessment:<span id="S6.T3.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> For BiGGen we evaluate two baselines using pre-generated outputs—Verbalized 2S and RF-LLMaaJ—for directly predicting human ratings. Consistency-based (requiring additional outputs) and the Verbalized 1S (requiring prompt re-design) are omitted.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
